      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER LEHIGH (7) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Abe Keeping (18.68) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Key chance in this line up. LEKTRA BELLA (4) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (18.63) at this track in a Grade 4. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. CHARGE THE CARD (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (19.31) in a Mix 2/3 at this track. Solid record here winning three races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from 10 starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. DENAWEN BEACH (2) is worth including.",
